# UI

Look like premium professional desktop software.

## Do

- Dark-first interface, clean spacing, minimal clutter
- Subtle borders, rounded cards for interactive containers
- Clear typography, accessible controls, keyboard-friendly nav
- Responsive desktop layout (sidebar + main)

## Don't

- Excessive gradients, overly colorful UI, huge empty spaces
- Generic dashboard templates, excessive animations

Cards only when they contain user interaction. Prefer quiet hierarchy over decoration.
